            "location_header": "ACT V",
            "visual_description": "Ancient Athens, 1200 BC. The grand palace hall at night, illuminated by flickering torchlight and glowing braziers. Deep shadows play between the towering marble columns. Rich purple banners appear dark in the dim light. In the foreground, banquet tables are cleared but festive. Warm, regal, and intimate atmosphere."
