      "identifier": "FOREST_DAWN",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "location_header": "ACT IV, SCENE 1 (Part 2)",
      "visual_description": "The ancient forest near Athens awakening at dawn, 1200 BC. Golden shafts of morning light pierce through lifting mist. Dew glistens on ferns and wildflowers. A moss-covered boulder in the foreground catches the warm light. Soft golds, pale greens, and misty whites. Peaceful, transitional mood.",
      "metadata": {},
      "image_key": "publications/759db4c17a42ab6cc39642ac4cfd7d24eeb4b03e/scenes/scene_FOREST_DAWN.jpg"
    },
    {
      "identifier": "ATHENS_PALACE_MAGIC",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "location_header": "ENTER PUCK",
      "visual_description": "Ancient Athens, 1200 BC. The palace hall after midnight. The torches have burned low to dying embers, casting long, eerie shadows. Blue moonlight spills across the polished marble floor. Spectral, glowing fairy lights begin to manifest in the corners. A mystical, hushed, and otherworldly atmosphere.",
      "metadata": {},
      "image_key": "publications/759db4c17a42ab6cc39642ac4cfd7d24eeb4b03e/scenes/scene_ATHENS_PALACE_MAGIC.jpg"
